2T06:17:21.157248+00:00", "id": 7856627, "conceptrecid": "7856626", "doi": "10.5281/zenodo.7856627", "conceptdoi": "10.5281/zenodo.7856626", "doi_url": "https://doi.org/10.5281/zenodo.7856627", "metadata": {"title": "OZON QATLAMI, UNING YEMIRILISHI, SALBIY OQIBATLARI  VA MUHOFAZA QILISH IMKONIYATLARI", "doi": "10.5281/zenodo.7856627", "publication_date": "2023-04-23", "description": "<p>Mazkur maqolada ozon gazlari, uni hosil bo&lsquo;lishi, ozon qatlami, chegarasi, miqdorining o&lsquo;zgarishi<br>\nva asosiy xususiyatlari bo&lsquo;yicha muhim ma&rsquo;lumotlar keltirilgan. Shuningdek, ozon qatlamini tabiiy<br>\nva antropogen omillar ta&rsquo;sirida yemirilib borishi hamda uni oldini olish imkoniyatlari bo&lsquo;yicha fikr mulohazalar ham keng yoritilgan.</p>", "access_right": "open", "creators": [{"name": "QORIYEV Mirzohid Rustamjonovich", "affiliation": null}, {"name": "BAXTIYOROV Rasulbek Jaloliddin o'g'li", "affiliation": null}], "keywords": ["ozon gazlari, ozon qatlami xususiyatlari, ozon qatlamining yemirilishi, \"ozon tuynugi\", ozon qatlamini muhofaza qilish imkoniyatlari."], "language": "uzb", "resource_type": {"title": "Journal article", "type": "publication", "subtype": "article"}, "journal": {"issue": "4", "pages": "25-31", "title": "\u0422\u0410\u0414\u049a\u0418\u049a\u041e\u0422 \u0412\u0410 \u0418\u041d\u041d\u041e\u0412\u0410\u0426\u0418\u042f\u041b\u0410\u0420 \u0416\u0423\u0420\u041d\u0410\u041b\u0418", "volume": "4"}, "license": {"id": "cc-by-4.0"}, "relations": {"version": [{"index": 0, "is_last": true, "parent": {"pid_type": "recid", "pid_value": "7856626"}}]}}, "title": "OZON QATLAMI, UNING YEMIRILISHI, SALBIY OQIBATLARI  VA MUHOFAZA QILISH IMKONIYATLARI", "links": {"self": "https://zenodo.org/api/records/7856627", "self_html": "https://zenodo.org/records/7856627", "preview_html": "https://zenodo.org/records/7856627?preview=1", "doi": "https://doi.org/10.5281/zenodo.7856627", "self_doi": "https://doi.org/10.5281/zenodo.7856627", "self_doi_html